<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:05:16 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>GTA VI 是手工制作的。在 GTA IV 期间负责 Take-Two 的人表示，人工智能可以让电影制作人制作下一款突破性游戏</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/gta-vi-take-two-ceo-ben-feder-ai-videogames-filmmaker/</link><description>Take-Two 表示生成式人工智能在 GTA VI 中没有发挥作用。本·费德 (Ben Feder) 表示，人工智能很快就会让新的创作者只需点击一下即可构建游戏。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305235738-e1795632435738.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:13:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/gta-vi-take-two-ceo-ben-feder-ai-videogames-filmmaker/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能的繁荣帮助提振了退休账户，但英伟达的惨败表明投资者的财务未来在多大程度上取决于少数股票</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/retirement-investors-tech-stocks-nasdaq-sp500-jensen-huang-ai-trade/</link><description>10 只股票占标准普尔 500 指数的 39%，近三分之二的 Fidelity 401(k) 储户将所有资金都存放在目标日期基金中。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2238399186-e1795641167791.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:37:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/retirement-investors-tech-stocks-nasdaq-sp500-jensen-huang-ai-trade/</guid></item><item><title>在捐赠了 260 亿美元之后，麦肯齐·斯科特的身家仍然达到 270 亿美元，并且刚刚又给了亚特兰大学生 800 万美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/mackenzie-scott-achieve-atlanta-8-million-net-worth/</link><description>她向Achieve Atlanta 捐赠的第二笔 800 万美元的礼物落在了亚马逊上，亚马逊目前位列财富 500 强，使她的净资产保持在 270 亿美元以上。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/AP26009739168602_260a6e.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:03:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/mackenzie-scott-achieve-atlanta-8-million-net-worth/</guid></item><item><title>洛杉矶湖人队宣布与卡尔希达成协议，标志着体育联盟越来越接受预测市场</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/la-lakers-announce-deal-with-kalshi-signaling-sports-leagues-growing-embrace-of-prediction-markets/</link><description>NBA 与其他大联盟一样欢迎预测市场，而 NFL 却反其道而行之。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2293051219-e1795628431681.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:41:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/la-lakers-announce-deal-with-kalshi-signaling-sports-leagues-growing-embrace-of-prediction-markets/</guid></item><item><title>高通首席营销官如何为后苹果时代重塑团队</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/how-qualcomms-cmo-is-reshaping-his-team-for-its-post-apple-era/</link><description>在失去与苹果的重要合作伙伴关系后，美国芯片制造商高通正在将重点转向数据中心和笔记本电脑。其首席营销官 Don McGuire 正在重塑公司的营销策略以支持转型。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2304003471_2880x1920.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:01:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/how-qualcomms-cmo-is-reshaping-his-team-for-its-post-apple-era/</guid></item><item><title>就在通胀数据接近美联储目标两倍的同一天，白宫宣布了一系列新关税</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/white-house-new-tariffs-inflation-data-expectations-fed/</link><description>Janus Henderson Investors 的投资组合经理布拉德福德·史密斯 (Bradford Smith) 向《财富》杂志表示：“由于通货膨胀已经成为一个问题，而且美联储正在等待之前关税实施的结束，额外的关税将使美联储的工作变得更加困难。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2306083518-e1795624766532.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:06:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/white-house-new-tariffs-inflation-data-expectations-fed/</guid></item><item><title>随着中国缩小军事差距，美国国防预算在联邦预算中所占的份额正被压缩至二战以来的最低水平</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/u-s-defense-federal-budget-china-military-investment-gap/</link><description>布鲁金斯学会的报告写道：“强大的军事力量和美国全球领导力的倡导者应该做好充分利用有限预算资源的准备。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2290361792-e1795605809442.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:25:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/u-s-defense-federal-budget-china-military-investment-gap/</guid></item><item><title>华为在美国审判中被判 10 项罪名，但判决不太可能减缓中国“国家冠军”的脚步</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/huawei-us-trial-racketeering-china-national-champion/</link><description>大西洋理事会的德克斯特·罗伯茨表示：“华为已经经受住了多年的制裁，仍然能够取得显着的增长和发展。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2302952808-e1795604340848.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:23:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/huawei-us-trial-racketeering-china-national-champion/</guid></item><item><title>前五角大楼官员表示，赫格斯在伊朗战争期间阻止参议员访问海湾基地“闻起来缺乏透明度”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/former-pentagon-officials-hegseth-blocking/</link><description>康涅狄格州参议员克里斯·墨菲 (Chris Murphy) 被拒绝访问美国驻卡塔尔基地后，指责国防部隐瞒了战争的真实成本。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2306101344-e1795630031807.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:01:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/former-pentagon-officials-hegseth-blocking/</guid></item><item><title>中期选举显示婴儿潮一代失去了对政治的控制力。他们对金钱的掌控是另一回事</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/midterms-baby-boomers-politics-money-debt/</link><description>婴儿潮一代在国会的席位正在减少，但他们仍然拥有大部分财富。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-1235252107-e1795633199519.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:00:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/25/midterms-baby-boomers-politics-money-debt/</guid></item></channel></rss>